## Summary Checklist

When writing code, ensure:

- [ ] Using `logger` instead of `print()` or `debugPrint()`
- [ ] Using appropriate log level (debug/info/warning/error)
- [ ] Including relevant context in messages
- [ ] Including error and stackTrace for error logs
- [ ] Not logging sensitive data
- [ ] Using category keywords for automatic filtering
- [ ] Including relevant IDs or identifiers
